    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An action role-playing game with elements of management and construction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Story]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the Doomsday, humanity forms a superpower legion to resist the King Of Doom and rebuild their homeland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Gameplay]</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit team members and train your squad.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up characters, enhance their abilities, change their professions, etc.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world, discover new enemies, scenes, items, outfits, and more.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your town to increase its strength.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest through loans to earn profits, etc.</p></li></ul>",
